      <title>Shrinkwrap 0.10.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Managed folders now carry a Finder colour label: green when the last run was clean, yellow when something was skipped, red when something failed. Finder Sync badges never appear inside Dropbox — a colour label does, and it syncs between Macs.</p>]]></description>
